iimg.com/photo/msid-133450697,imgsize-226675.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Israel accuses Gaza of launching balloons and kites; responds with airstrikes]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/133450563.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/middle-east/israel-accuses-gaza-of-launching-drones-balloons-and-kites-responds-with-two-airstrikes-killing-four-year-old/articleshow/133450563.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/middle-east/israel-accuses-gaza-of-launching-drones-balloons-and-kites-responds-with-two-airstrikes-killing-four-year-old/articleshow/133450563.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-08-24T09:19:11+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">Aadrita Halder</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-133450598,imgsize-618367.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[UK PM Burnham to visit Kyiv as Ukraine turns 35, Britain to boost long-range strike capability]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/133450133.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[On Ukraine's Independence Day, Prime Minister Andy Burnham plans an official visit to Kyiv, where he will engage with President Volodymyr Zelenskyy and take charge of the Coalition of the Willing. The UK aims to enhance Ukraine's defense capabilities by sharing classified missile technology for domestic assembly. This initiative underscores Britain’s commitment to supporting Ukraine's security and fortifying their long-standing alliance.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/uk/uk-pm-burnham-to-visit-kyiv-as-ukraine-turns-35-britain-to-boost-long-range-strike-capability/articleshow/133450133.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/uk/uk-pm-burnham-to-visit-kyiv-as-ukraine-turns-35-britain-to-boost-long-range-strike-capability/articleshow/133450133.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-08-24T09:28:40+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">Pranjal Pandey</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-133450133,imgsize-53296.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA['Did not meet launch conditions': China's unmanned moon mission delayed last minute]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/133449841.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/china/did-not-meet-launch-conditions-chinas-unmanned-moon-mission-delayed-last-minutehl/articleshow/133449841.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/china/did-not-meet-launch-conditions-chinas-unmanned-moon-mission-delayed-last-minutehl/articleshow/133449841.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-08-24T08:22:15+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">Prisha Roy</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-133449874,imgsize-124392.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[TikToker Ayesha Gilamana murder case takes shocking turn as police uncover family link]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/133446062.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[Authorities are delving into a chilling possibility of familial ties in the murder of TikTok star Ayesha Gilamana. Five people, including her father and brother, have been taken into custody amid allegations of an honour killing. Investigators have revealed technical evidence and CCTV footage that link the family to the crime. The inquiry aims to clarify the specific roles of those involved in this tragic case.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us-streamers/tiktoker-ayesha-gilamana-murder-case-takes-shocking-turn-as-police-uncover-family-link/articleshow/133446062.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us-streamers/tiktoker-ayesha-gilamana-murder-case-takes-shocking-turn-as-police-uncover-family-link/articleshow/133446062.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-08-24T00:49:01+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">Global Sports Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-133446114,imgsize-48920.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Twitch streamer Kameaisweird’s Uber ride takes unexpected turn after driver recognizes her]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/133446445.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[Twitch streamer Kameaisweird found herself in a harrowing Uber experience on August 22, 2026, as the driver made transphobic comments and insisted she stop filming. In a moment of defiance, Kamea splashed water at him before making her exit. Viewers quickly began to debate the reality of the situation and Kamea's decision to respond visibly, resulting in a vibrant dialogue on social media.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us-streamers/twitch-streamer-kameaisweirds-uber-ride-takes-unexpected-turn-after-driver-recognizes-her/articleshow/133446445.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us-streamers/twitch-streamer-kameaisweirds-uber-ride-takes-unexpected-turn-after-driver-recognizes-her/articleshow/133446445.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-08-24T01:43:17+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">Global Sports Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-133446453,imgsize-642024.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[TikTok food influencer Doctor Food arrested in Lebanon over alleged drug-linked food products]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/133446530.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[Lebanese authorities arrested TikTok food influencer Georges Dib, known as Doctor Food, on August 23. He was sought for alleged drug-related crimes involving food products made by his businesses. Police had reportedly been searching for Dib for years and he was previously sentenced in absentia. Investigators believe Dib avoided capture while continuing to post videos online for his followers.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us-streamers/tiktok-food-influencer-doctor-food-arrested-in-lebanon-over-alleged-drug-linked-food-products/articleshow/133446530.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us-streamers/tiktok-food-influencer-doctor-food-arrested-in-lebanon-over-alleged-drug-linked-food-products/articleshow/133446530.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-08-24T02:35:35+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">Global Sports Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-133446535,imgsize-716566.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Homicide Ruling Detailed: LA examiner finds Celeste’s death was homicide; D4vd lawyers deny murder]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/133448615.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[A newly unsealed medical examiner’s report has revealed that Celeste Rivas Hernandez died from multiple penetrating injuries, with her death officially classified as a homicide. The findings add a major development to the case involving streamer D4vd, who faces a first-degree murder charge and has pleaded not guilty. His attorneys maintain his innocence, while Celeste’s family continues to seek justice following the teenager’s death and disturbing discovery of her remains.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us-streamers/d4vd-murder-investigation-streamer-faces-new-scrutiny-after-chilling-details-about-celestes-death-emerge/articleshow/133448615.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us-streamers/d4vd-murder-investigation-streamer-faces-new-scrutiny-after-chilling-details-about-celestes-death-emerge/articleshow/133448615.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-08-24T05:52:00+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">Global Sports Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-133448629,imgsize-142982.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[We Are Charlie Kirk Controversy: Hasan Piker hits back at backlash; calls Republicans “grifters”]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/133448601.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[Hasan Piker has responded to backlash over singing “We Are Charlie Kirk” during a live show, dismissing what he called repeated “fake outrage.” In a fiery stream, the Twitch commentator claimed he was more respectful toward Charlie Kirk than Erika Kirk and criticized Republicans attempting to carry Kirk’s legacy. Piker also called them “goddamn grifters,” adding fresh fuel to an already heated controversy surrounding his performance.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us-streamers/twitch-streamer-hasan-piker-takes-aim-at-erika-kirk-after-we-are-charlie-kirk-controversy-these-guys-are-all-goddamn-grifters/articleshow/133448601.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us-streamers/twitch-streamer-hasan-piker-takes-aim-at-erika-kirk-after-we-are-charlie-kirk-controversy-these-guys-are-all-goddamn-grifters/articleshow/133448601.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-08-24T05:32:16+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">Global Sports Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-133448602,imgsize-111986.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Nevada wildfire: 90,000 people face evacuation as state of emergency declared]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/133449186.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/nevada-wildfire-90000-people-face-evacuation-as-state-of-emergency-declared/articleshow/133449186.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/nevada-wildfire-90000-people-face-evacuation-as-state-of-emergency-declared/articleshow/133449186.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-08-24T07:35:13+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">Karan Manral</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-133449359,imgsize-62602.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[A businessman bought a 23,000-acre Scottish sporting estate and spent two decades rewilding it]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/133446238.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[An ambitious English businessman has reimagined a historic Scottish hunting estate as a lush wilderness reserve. His initiative, which includes the planting of over one million native trees, has revived populations of red squirrels in the glens. The project also emphasizes the restoration of peatlands and the breeding of Scottish wildcats, with funding from upscale eco-tourism driving significant conservation efforts to protect and restore local ecosystems for the future.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/uk/a-businessman-bought-a-23